<title>USA: Embryo Development appoints CFO as CEO.</title>
<headline>Embryo Development appoints CFO as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Embryo Development Corp said Thursday it had appointed Matthew Harriton as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Harriton will continue to serve as chief financial officer, it said.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
